 "nct_id": "NCT00789035",
 "brief_title": "12 Weeks Treatment With 3 Different Doses of BI 10773 in Type 2 Diabetic Patients",
 "official_title": "A Phase IIb, Randomized, Parallel Group Safety, Efficacy, and Pharmacokinetics Study of BI 10773 (5 mg, 10 mg and 25 mg) Administered Orally Once Daily Over 12 Weeks Compared Double Blind to Placebo, as Monotherapy, With an Additional Open-label Metformin Arm in Type 2 Diabetic Patients With Insufficient Glycemic Control",
